  "releaseNotes": "'## [14.1.0](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v14.0.0...v14.1.0) (2026-11-24)\n\n### Features\n\n* **operator:** write with an explicit field manager configured per operator ([#1346](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1346)) ([4bf6fb2](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/4bf6fb2ad137dd56bcc0fcaa9d4cc045a8adaa12)), closes [#1345](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1345)\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **ci:** update dependency @semantic-release/github to v12.0.11 ([#1335](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1335)) ([7fbb58a](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/7fbb58ad3dc11621f0c7b0b2876155c499bf6800))\n* **core:** remove the obsolete MessagePack pin ([#1347](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1347)) ([5d1c108](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/5d1c108158e96400eb1d341caa7e0cdff44d1086)), closes [#1340](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1340)\n* **core:** update dependency sonaranalyzer.csharp to 10.37.0.15768 ([#1343](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1343)) ([f379009](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/f3790092d4c0d95de243f6a60db2c9f6d5783629))\n* **core:** update dependency stylecop.analyzers to 1.4.26-beta ([#1339](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1339)) ([0ce9463](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/0ce94634849066b0314bcdb639a8447d84cc43fa))\n* **core:** update dependency ziggycreatures.fusioncache to 2.10.0 ([#1344](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1344)) ([5fe450a](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/5fe450a19af3f8ff8af231ee9ad25087ab3eeb54))\n* **core:** update dotnet monorepo to 10.11.1 ([#1342](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1342)) ([037eaee](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/037eaee7b60764211ecc2ac7c84006cdb6e8de03))\n'",
